title: CatPainting
---
<<declare $cat_painting_interaction_times = 0>>

<<if $cat_painting_interaction_times == 0>>
 It's a painting of a cat.
 Something about the way the colors interact makes it seem like the cat is almost glowing.
 <<set $cat_painting_interaction_times = 1>>
<<elseif $cat_painting_interaction_times == 1>>
 Looking at it again it seems as if the cat was in fact, not glowing. 
 You feel disheartened by this information.
 <<set $cat_painting_interaction_times = 2>>
<<else>>
 Looking one final time, you decide that the cat, while not glowing, is radiating in your heart. 
 You will remember this cat. 
<<endif>>
===
